{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05498","headline":"和陈校书省中翫雪 · 包融","name":"和陈校书省中翫雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芸阁朝来雪，飘颻正满空。\n褰开明月下，校理落花中。\n色向怀铅白，光因翰简融。\n能令草玄者，回思入流风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05498.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05498","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}